  "content": "\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <h1>可視屏障</h1>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/AmyMialee\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.3.1/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aEghXGbm3J\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.3.1/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visiblebarriers\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visiblebarriers\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <div>可視屏障是一款對地圖製作人與地圖測試者非常實用的模組。</div>\n  <div>它提供了多種用於地圖製作與測試的工具，例如透過快捷鍵（預設為 B）將屏障方塊渲染為實心方塊的功能。</div>\n  <div>它也支援查看標記實體（需安裝於伺服器端）。</div>\n  <div>此外還具備多種其他功能，例如縮放快捷鍵、全亮模式，以及可在客戶端設定遊戲時間的功能！</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://github.com/AmyMialeeMods/visible-barriers/raw/main/assets/barriers.png\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n<b>有興趣為我的模組架設伺服器嗎？</b>  \n推薦使用 Bloom Host：  \n<a href=\"https://billing.bloom.host/aff.php?aff=10/\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h4556XW.gif\">\n</a>  \n<b>透過此連結購買伺服器將直接支持我！</b>\n</div>",
